== 2026

- *2026-07* \M Paper accepted: "Multi-domain Time Series Reconstruction with
  Frequency-Enhanced Transformers" (Khanh Trang Duong, Phuong L. Vo, Tung Kieu,
  Duc Ngoc Minh Dang) in ''Lecture Notes in Computer Science''.

- *2026-06* \M Paper accepted: "Secure Semantic Communications with Adversarial
  Training and Active Eavesdropper" (Quang-Tinh Thai, Toan-Van Nguyen,
  Trung-Nghia Nguyen, Tung Kieu, Phuong Luu Vo) in ''Lecture Notes in Computer
  Science''.

- *2026-06* \M Three undergraduate students successfully defended their theses:
  Thai Quang Tinh, Dang Dang Khoi, and Dang Danh Huong. Congratulations to all
  three.

== 2025

- *2025-11* \M Paper accepted: "Semantic Communication with Transformer and
  Knowledge Distillation for Language Translation" (Huy Thanh Nguyen,
  Thuy An Nguyen, Tung Kieu, Toan-Van Nguyen, Phuong Luu Vo) in
  ''Communications in Computer and Information Science''.

- *2025-11* \M Paper accepted: "Secure Cooperative Semantic Communication with
  Swin Transformer and Jamming" (Hung Ngo Luu Tan, Toan-Van Nguyen,
  Phuong Luu Vo) in ''Lecture Notes in Computer Science''.

== 2024

- *2024-10* \M Paper accepted: "Security Improvement for Deep Learning-Based
  Semantic Communication Systems" (Hung Ngo Luu Tan, Van-Dinh Nguyen,
  Thien Huynh-The, Toan-Van Nguyen, Phuong Luu Vo) at the ''2024 International
  Conference on Advanced Technologies for Communications (ATC)''.

